== _Hong et al._ boundary distance definition<app-microc>
#todo[short explainer and citation of the Micro-C paper where they actually define this.]
_Boundary distance_ is defined as $"boundary_distance"_i = min_j |"insertion_site"_i - "boundary"_j|$, where $"boundary"_j in B$ and the set of boundaries $B$ is
$
B = argmin_i {C(i) | i in [L]}
$
$
C(i) = sum_((x,y)) bb(1)[x < i < y]bb(1)[500 <= y - x <= 10,000]
$
where $i$ is any position in a genome of length $L$.

